Building and installing xpenguins
=================================

This project uses CMake (Autotools support has been removed).

Dependencies:
  - X11 (libX11, libXext, libXpm)
  - libXfixes (optional, for click-through input shape)
  - CMake >= 3.16
  - pkg-config

Build:

  cmake -B build -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr/local
  cmake --build build
  sudo cmake --install build

Or with Nix:

  nix build
  nix run

See README.md for runtime options (overlay vs classic drawing).
